WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
10 July 1940, in Vichy,

2
00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.630
a spa town.

3
00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.820
Deputies and senators vote.

4
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:10.240
569 for. 80 against.

5
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.360
20 abstentions. Today,
the 80 who said no are

6
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.670
honoured as «les quatre-vingts».

7
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.580
Full powers go to a marshal of 84,

8
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.990
«le vainqueur de Verdun».

9
00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.810
With those powers, what did he build?

10
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.730
In this mission, you'll trace
how support for him shifted,

11
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.010
from 1940 to 1945.

12
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:32.700
Then you'll judge his defenders' claim:

13
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.360
was he «le bouclier», the shield,

14
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.900
or something else?

15
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.570
Your mission: uncover what he built,

16
00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:42.030
policy by policy, and judge it.
